                                "sense_id": "23324f69-ea7b-3a61-96e4-a081cbea81f5",
                                "text": "Het is van hier naar Omsk nog een kleine honderd werst / 't Is prettig dat de paarden net vanmiddag zijn ververst / Maar jammer dat de wolven ons toch hebben ingehaald / Men ziet de flinke eetlust die hun uit de ogen straalt",
                                "translation": "We have just under 100 verst to go from here to Omsk / How nice that the horses were changed just this afternoon / But too bad the wolves caught up with us anyway / One can see the considerable appetite radiating from their eyes",
                                "english": "We have just under 100 verst to go from here to Omsk / How nice that the horses were changed just this afternoon / But too bad the wolves caught up with us anyway / One can see the considerable appetite radiating from their eyes"
